{{#> layout
  title="Language Learning Is Hard and Will Always Be Hard"
  url='/language-learning-is-hard.html'
}}
  <style>
    /* Long-form essay layout for language-learning-is-hard.html. */

    .ise-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.08);
      color: var(--v-color-primary);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .llh {
      max-width: 42rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.7;

      & p {
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
    }

    .llh-header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
    }

    .llh-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .llh-intro {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
    }

    .llh-section {
      margin-top: 3.5rem;
    }

    .llh-callout {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0 0 2rem;
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem 1.75rem 5.25rem;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.05);

      & p {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
        font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.35;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      }
    }

    .llh-callout-number {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1.75rem;
      left: 1.75rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 2.5rem;
      height: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: var(--v-color-primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .llh-stats,
    .llh-habits {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;

      & li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
        background: var(--v-color-body-bg);
        color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      }

      & i {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.1);
        color: var(--v-color-primary);
      }
    }

    .llh-stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      @media (width >= 576px) {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      & li {
        padding: 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 3rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      & i {
        width: 2.75rem;
        height: 2.75rem;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }
    }

    .llh-habits {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      @media (width >= 576px) {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      & li {
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
      }

      & i {
        width: 2.25rem;
        height: 2.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
    }

    .llh-closing {
      margin-top: 4rem;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.05);
      text-align: center;

      & > p {
        max-width: 30rem;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
        font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.35;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      }
    }

    .llh-cta {
      max-width: 22rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    @media (width < 576px) {
      .llh {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .llh-intro {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .llh-callout {
        padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.25rem 4.25rem;
      }

      .llh-callout-number {
        top: 1.25rem;
        left: 1.25rem;
        width: 2.25rem;
        height: 2.25rem;
      }

      .llh-closing {
        padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  {{#> text-container }}
    <article class="llh">
      <header class="llh-header">
        <span class="ise-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-journal-text" aria-hidden="true"></i> Active language usage</span>
        <h1 class="llh-title">Language Learning Is Hard and Will Always Be Hard</h1>
      </header>

      <p class="llh-intro">Deep down, we already know it. That's why we're so surprised when someone we've known for years suddenly starts speaking a foreign language. It almost never happens.</p>

      <section class="llh-section">
        <blockquote class="llh-callout">
          <span class="llh-callout-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <p>Language learning requires thousands of hours of practice and thousands of words to learn.</p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>To reach fluency (B2 in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_European_Framework_of_Reference_for_Languages" class="link-secondary" target="_blank">CEFR</a> terms), a person must:</p>

        <ul class="llh-stats">
          <li><i class="bi bi-hourglass-split" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Study and practice for 8,00 to 2,000 hours</span></li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-book" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Learn 6,000 to 8,000 words</span></li>
        </ul>

        <p>Thousands of hours of practice and thousands of words are no joke. It takes years &ndash; that's why so many people give up, and why so few are fluent in three or more languages.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="llh-section">
        <blockquote class="llh-callout">
          <span class="llh-callout-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <p>Successful language learners are active language users.</p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>Those who understand the enormous scope of language learning don't rely on apps and courses &ndash; they weave the foreign language into their lives.</p>

        <ul class="llh-habits">
          <li><i class="bi bi-book-half" aria-hidden="true"></i>They read books</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-newspaper" aria-hidden="true"></i>They consume news</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-youtube" aria-hidden="true"></i>They watch YouTube</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-headphones" aria-hidden="true"></i>They listen to podcasts</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i>They think in the foreign language</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-chat-dots" aria-hidden="true"></i>They jump on every opportunity to use it</li>
        </ul>

        <p>They start as soon as they reach a stable A2 level. It's hard, but they persevere and eventually become fluent.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="llh-section">
        <blockquote class="llh-callout">
          <span class="llh-callout-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <p>Becoming fluent in a foreign language improves your life.</p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>Pursuing fluency in a foreign language tangibly improves people's lives. They become more articulate. They find better jobs, better friends, and better partners. They move to better countries.</p>
      </section>

      <footer class="llh-closing">
        <p>Vocably is designed for such people &ndash; for those who know that language learning is no joke.</p>

        <div class="llh-cta">
          {{> cta }}
        </div>
      </footer>
    </article>
  {{/text-container}}

{{/layout}}
